{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LnwMCae4CqEp28HcU3tvWY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Experiment Plan — structfuse-context (Route A: Analysis Paper)\n2\t# 最后更新: 2026-05-13 | 更新原因: D034 reframe 为 \"When Does Consensus Fail\" 分析论文\n3\t\n4\texperiments:\n5\t  # === GPT-2 Task Coverage (Claim 2: CSS fails on majority of configs) ===\n6\t  - plan_id: plan_001\n7\t    name: \"GPT-2 IOI K=3 CSS\"\n8\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\", \"Claim 4\"]\n9\t    description: \"GPT-2 Small / IOI, K=3 (EAP-IG + EP + ACDC isinf). Lone positive case — CSS=1.0 CPR > single method\"\n10\t    registry_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\n11\t    priority: P0\n12\t    status: done\n13\t    result: \"PASS — CSS=1.0 (7 edges) CPR=0.109 > all single methods; Jaccard=0.31\"\n14\t\n15\t  - plan_id: plan_002\n16\t    name: \"GPT-2 Arithmetic K=3 CSS\"\n17\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\", \"Claim 4\"]\n18\t    description: \"GPT-2 Small / Greaterthan, K=3. Task structure forces high Jaccard → CSS fails\"\n19\t    registry_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\n20\t    priority: P0\n21\t    status: done\n22\t    result: \"FAIL — CSS=1.0 CPR < EAP-IG; Jaccard=0.695 (methods too correlated)\"\n23\t\n24\t  - plan_id: plan_003\n25\t    name: \"GPT-2 SVA K=3 CSS\"\n26\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\", \"Claim 4\"]\n27\t    description: \"GPT-2 Small / SVA. Inconclusive — marginal signal at noise level\"\n28\t    registry_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk\n29\t    priority: P0\n30\t    status: done\n31\t    result: \"INCONCLUSIVE — D033: cross-server Δ=0.006/0.013, avg < 0.01 threshold\"\n32\t\n33\t  - plan_id: plan_004\n34\t    name: \"GPT-2 Factual Recall K=3 CSS\"\n35\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\", \"Claim 4\"]\n36\t    description: \"GPT-2 Small / Country-Capital factual recall. MLP-based knowledge retrieval circuit\"\n37\t    registry_id: gpt2_factual_recall_k3_v2\n38\t    priority: P0\n39\t    status: running\n40\t    depends_on: []\n41\t    gpu_hours_est: 1\n42\t\n43\t  # === ACDC Binarization Pathology (Claim 1: strongest contribution) ===\n44\t  - plan_id: plan_005\n45\t    name: \"ACDC isinf→top-k binarization sweep\"\n46\t    claim: [\"Claim 1\"]\n47\t    description: \"k=50/75/100/150 on IOI and Arithmetic. Show isinf→top-k Jaccard shift and CSS degeneration break\"\n48\t    priority: P0\n49\t    status: done\n50\t    result: \"Confirmed: isinf causes CSS=1.0≡ACDC; top-k breaks degeneration; Jaccard shifts +0.16 to +0.25\"\n51\t\n52\t  # === Cross-Model Scaling Failure (Claim 3: component-level scoring) ===\n53\t  - plan_id: plan_006\n54\t    name: \"Qwen-0.5B IOI K=3 with IFR\"\n55\t    claim: [\"Claim 3\"]\n56\t    description: \"First scaling attempt. IFR degenerates to block-voting (layer-level), zero CSS=1.0 edges\"\n57\t    registry_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3\n58\t    priority: P0\n59\t    status: done\n60\t    result: \"FAIL — IFR Jaccard=0.000 with gradient methods; block-voting granularity mismatch\"\n61\t\n62\t  - plan_id: plan_007\n63\t    name: \"Qwen-0.5B IOI K=3 with ACDC\"\n64\t    claim: [\"Claim 3\"]\n65\t    description: \"D029: ACDC替代IFR. ACDC also degenerates to node-level scoring on 179K-edge model\"\n66\t    registry_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3\n67\t    priority: P0\n68\t    status: done\n69\t    result: \"FAIL — ACDC node-level scoring; all Jaccard≈0; zero CSS=1.0 edges. Confirms scaling failure is structural\"\n70\t\n71\t  # === Critical Controls (Dream reviewers unanimously requested) ===\n72\t  - plan_id: plan_008\n73\t    name: \"IOI size-controlled baseline\"\n74\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\"]\n75\t    description: \"Compare CSS=1.0 (N edges) vs top-N of each single method + random-N. Rules out size confound\"\n76\t    priority: P0\n77\t    status: running\n78\t    depends_on: [plan_001]\n79\t    gpu_hours_est: 0.5\n80\t\n81\t  - plan_id: plan_009\n82\t    name: \"Bootstrap confidence intervals on CPR\"\n83\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\"]\n84\t    description: \"Bootstrap CIs on all CPR differences across all completed experiments\"\n85\t    priority: P1\n86\t    status: planned\n87\t    depends_on: [plan_004, plan_008]\n88\t    gpu_hours_est: 1\n89\t\n90\t  # === Comparative / Ablation ===\n91\t  - plan_id: plan_010\n92\t    name: \"CIRCUS negative ablation\"\n93\t    claim: [\"Claim 5\"]\n94\t    description: \"D021: CIRCUS failed 3×. Within-method threshold diversity produces negative CPR on all tasks\"\n95\t    priority: P1\n96\t    status: done\n97\t    result: \"CIRCUS negative CPR on all tasks. Implementation caveats noted\"\n98\t    gpu_hours_est: 0\n99\t\n100\t  - plan_id: plan_011\n101\t    name: \"Ablation method comparison (zero vs mean)\"\n102\t    claim: [\"Claim 2\"]\n103\t    description: \"Compare zero and mean ablation on IOI. Dream worst-tier identified zero ablation bias as IOI confound\"\n104\t    priority: P1\n105\t    status: planned\n106\t    depends_on: [plan_008]\n107\t    gpu_hours_est: 1\n108\t\n109\t  # === Discussion Analyses ===\n110\t  - plan_id: plan_012\n111\t    name: \"IFR vs ACDC vs gradient method divergence analysis\"\n112\t    claim: [\"Claim 3\"]\n113\t    description: \"Document IFR and ACDC failure modes on Qwen as case study for component-level scoring issue\"\n114\t    priority: P2\n115\t    status: planned\n116\t    depends_on: [plan_006, plan_007]\n117\t    gpu_hours_est: 0\n118\t\n119\t  - plan_id: plan_013\n120\t    name: \"Jaccard-CSS scatter plot + correlation\"\n121\t    claim: [\"Claim 4\"]\n122\t    description: \"Across all completed experiments, plot max Jaccard vs CSS advantage. Report honestly as underpowered (n≤6)\"\n123\t    priority: P1\n124\t    status: planned\n125\t    depends_on: [plan_004, plan_008]\n126\t    gpu_hours_est: 0\n127\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EyvyTJLeHCS14HM3aHx2sg","session_id":"d5948ce3-0bd6-4774-9a29-31d903f57111","uuid":"0c86aedd-7ff6-439a-abbf-6c50d73801b1","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:56:27.604Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012eB6A3RQ67BXFFDwS5GJ3C","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — structfuse-context\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 越界教训 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n第三次 GPU 越界事件：PID 897752 占用 cuda:0（属于 rl-active-probe-fl），导致对方数据丢失。根因：旧进程或直接运行库模块时未设 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES，torch 默认使用 cuda:0。\\\\n\\\\n**硬规则**：\\\\n- 项目只有 cuda:5@cqa1-21977，所有 .py 文件（含库模块）必须在 import torch 前用 `os.environ.setdefault(\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\")` 防护\\\\n- 入口脚本用 `os.environ[\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\"] = \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\"`（强制覆盖），库模块用 `setdefault`（不覆盖入口已设的值）\\\\n- Worker 提交实验必须用 submit_training_job（自动管理 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES），禁止 nohup\\\\n\\\\n## ACDC isinf 退化——核心方法论问题 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\nACDC binarization 用 `isinf` 只选出极少边（IOI 14, Arithmetic 17），但 ACDC 实际有 0.03-0.09 四级中间分数。isinf 导致 CSS=1.0 与 ACDC 完全重合，跨方法共识退化。top-k binarization（k=50-75）解决此问题：Arithmetic CSS 3/3 从 17→44-54。\\\\n\\\\n**但 top-k 未翻转条件④**：CSS=1.0 mean CPR=0.919 < EAP-IG=0.985。\\\\n\\\\n## D021: CSS-only 叙事 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n放弃 CIRCUS 作为独立 claim。转 CSS-only 叙事。\\\\n\\\\n## 竞争定位：CSS vs CIRCUS (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n- **CIRCUS (Parekh, 2026)** 最大竞争对手。CSS 差异化 = method diversity > threshold diversity\\\\n- **Mondorf et al.** direct competitor：仅 gradient 族、score averaging（非 binary consensus）\\\\n- 关键支撑：Miller et al. (COLM 2024) faithfulness 对消融敏感；Méloux et al. EAP/EAP-IG 高方差\\\\n\\\\n## D026: MVP Gate 最终结论 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n**Arithmetic 条件④ FAIL（CSS=1.0 < EAP-IG），IOI PASS。**\\\\n\\\\n关键教训：\\\\n1. **Zero ablation 是 artifact 源**——所有小电路 zero CPR 为负，mean ablation 翻正到 0.9+\\\\n2. **节点级 ablation 的局限**——CSS=1.0 CPR 在 k=50→75 不变（节点集相同，边数变化无法区分）\\\\n3. **EAP-IG×EP 在 arithmetic 上 Jaccard=0.695**——两方法高度一致，CSS 缺少第三方视角的信息增益\\\\n4. **IOI 上 CSS 边效率极高**——14 edges CPR≈50 edges 单方法，每条边贡献远超单方法\\\\n5. **IOI CPR 不一致是误报**——mean_ablation_results.json 中标注为 IOI 的数据实际是 Arithmetic\\\\n\\\\n**等待 Director 决策：edge-efficiency claim / 原 claim + 更多任务 / pivot。**\\\\n\\\\n## IFR 作为第三方法——已证伪 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n**phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3 (negative)**: Qwen-2.5 0.5B 上 IFR 与 EAP-IG/EP 的 Jaccard = 0.00。\\\\n\\\\n**D028 诊断结论**:\\\\n1. **Per-head 分解无效**: IFR 已经在用 per-head 分解，不是修复方向\\\\n2. **根本原因**: IFR (proximity) 度量 activation magnitude → 偏向高幅度 MLP 输出 (m2, m20, m22)；gradient 方法度量 causal influence → 偏向任务关键 attention heads (a20.h9)。两者解构的是不同维度\\\\n3. **Jaccard sweep**: 首次非零在 N=500 (J=0.045)，unique_score_rank 展开到 2191 边也仅 J=0.065\\\\n4. **Destination-side 退化 100%**: 同层头共享 residual stream，所有头得到相同 destination score\\\\n\\\\n**结论**: IFR 不能作为 CSS 第三方法用于大模型。gradient 族内部仍有共识（EAP-IG×EP Jaccard=0.54）。Phase 2 需要替代第三方法（ACDC top-k 或另一个 gradient 方法）。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2263, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VEc7qrgHBiC2ohLyKcEz7X","session_id":"d5948ce3-0bd6-4774-9a29-31d903f57111","uuid":"9dc0b314-82fa-44a6-8dae-12fa9291f6ee","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:56:27.565Z"}
