{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DNtRJjqVPFzcBqrT8Qu9HN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# structfuse-context — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 UTC | 更新原因: 更新当前进展与近期任务（IOI PASS_MAIN, Arithmetic 运行中）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n跨方法二值共识（CSS）用于鲁棒电路编辑：证明 binary stability scoring + family-agreement constraint 在分布偏移下优于 score averaging 和单方法电路。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: MVP 验证 — IOI 已 PASS_MAIN（off-diagonal 13.3%），Arithmetic 确认实验运行中\\\\n- **核心假设**: CSS off-diagonal ≥5%（D021 CSS-only gate，D024 覆盖 D002）\\\\n- **基础设施**: cqa1-21977 (cuda:5, RTX 4090D) 已配置\\\\n- **大模型方案已定 (D006)**: IFR 作为第三方法，triangulation 框架定位\\\\n- **目标**: EMNLP 2026 Main（ARR deadline 2026-05-25，剩余 12 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 方法配置\\\\n| 模型 | K | 方法 | 算法族 |\\\\n|------|---|------|--------|\\\\n| GPT-2 Small | 3 | EAP-IG + Edge Pruning + ACDC | gradient / mask / greedy causal |\\\\n| Qwen-2.5 0.5B | 3 | EAP-IG + Edge Pruning + IFR | gradient / mask / similarity |\\\\n| Gemma-2 2B | 3 | EAP-IG + Edge Pruning + IFR | gradient / mask / similarity |\\\\n| Llama-3.1 8B | 3 | EAP-IG + Edge Pruning + IFR | gradient / mask / similarity |\\\\n\\\\n论文需披露：GPT-2 Small CSS = 3 因果方法共识；大模型 CSS = 2 因果 + 1 相似度方法共识（triangulation）。\\\\n\\\\n## MVP Gate 规则（D001-D003）\\\\n| off-diagonal % | 决策 |\\\\n|---|---|\\\\n| ≥10% | → Main track |\\\\n| 5-10% | → Findings + 追加 Arithmetic 验证 |\\\\n| 2-5% | → Findings 确认 |\\\\n| <2% (两组) + ΔF 无差异 | → Kill |\\\\n\\\\n## 阶段规划\\\\n\\\\n### Phase 1: MVP pilot（当前）\\\\n- GPT-2 Small / IOI，K=3（3 因果族），~2h → off-diagonal 判定\\\\n\\\\n### Phase 2: K=3 checkpoint + 全量 CSS（MVP 后 ~3天）\\\\n- Qwen-2.5 0.5B / IOI K=3（含 IFR）快速检查\\\\n- 全 4 模型 × 4 任务 CSS 计算\\\\n- 确认 Edge Pruning 实现：princeton-nlp/edge-pruning（非 auto-circuit mask gradient）\\\\n\\\\n### Phase 3: OOD editing（~4天）\\\\n### Phase 4: 分析 + 写作（~3天，最迟 5月22日）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3 完成 → gate 判定\\\\n- [ ] Gate PASS 后 complete_mvp → 进入 research\\\\n- [ ] 写 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [ ] 部署 IFR + Phase 2 实验脚本到服务器\\\\n- [ ] 下载目标模型（Qwen-2.5 0.5B 优先）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: 1× RTX 4090D (cuda:5@cqa1-21977)\\\\n- MVP: ~2h | 全量: ~290h A100（需后续扩卡）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-13 | D035: Reframe 为分析论文 Route A — \\\\\\\"When Does Cross-Met | mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3, phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3, mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3 |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-13 | D034: Qwen ACDC 确认 CSS 跨模型 scaling 根本性失败——问题不在方法选择 | phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3, phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3, mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-13 | D033: SVA 判定降级为 inconclusive——单 seed Δ=0.013 不具鲁棒性 | mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk, mvp_sva_gpt2_k3 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-13 | D032: 条件④评估指标修正——必须用 css_1.00 而非 css_0.67 | mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk, mvp_sva_gpt2_k3 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-13 | 统一 D025 条件④标准：zero PASS 或 mean Δ≥0.01，SVA 两次均判 neg | mvp_sva_gpt2_k3, mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-13 | SVA D025 gate FAIL（zero FAIL / mean 边际 Δ=0.008）；发现 | mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-13 | Phase 2 第三方法：放弃 IFR，改用 ACDC top-k。IFR 跨族分歧作为 Discu | phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-13 | Phase 2 IFR 零重叠问题：暂停 Qwen/Gemma 新实验，先修 IFR per-hea | phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 最终判定：CSS faithfulness 优势 task-dependent（IOI PA | mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3, mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-13 | Arithmetic D025 gate FAIL（条件④），暂不判 MVP 结果，先做 ACDC  | mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3059, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VEc7qrgHBiC2ohLyKcEz7X","session_id":"d5948ce3-0bd6-4774-9a29-31d903f57111","uuid":"15372fb0-e62e-4de1-a51b-f617ea2c02b7","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:56:33.640Z"}
